  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/533835/diamond-spheres-hustle-bustle?src=newest%3Faffiliate_id%3D3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Hustle &amp; Bustle</a></sup></p>\n<p>You gain Knowledge (planes), Knowledge (religion), Sleight of Hand, and Stealth as class skills. You can use your Intelligence or Wisdom modifier in place of your Dexterity modifier when attempting Stealth or Sleight of Hand checks, chosen when you take this talent.</p>\n<p>You may select this talent a second time, in which case you may use the better of the two ability score modifiers on both of the listed skills</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc100\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
